This is Nigeria Life: a browser 3D life sim of Nigeria (TypeScript + Vite + Three.js) in nigeria-life/.

Goal: beat Lagos Life. The full plan is in nigeria-life/docs/MASTER-PLAN.md. Read it before big tasks.

Rules:
- Take inspiration from Lagos Life's mechanics only. Never copy its code, art, text or branding.
- Follow docs/ART-BIBLE.md for visuals.
- Keep `npx tsc --noEmit` passing after every change.
- Never break existing features. Keep public APIs stable when refactoring.
- When the save shape changes, bump SAVE_SCHEMA_VERSION in src/backend/types.ts and add a migration in SaveSchema.ts.
- Money must never be changed directly by UI code. Always go through BackendService/TransactionService.
- Do one task at a time, then summarise what changed and which files.
